side entrance of the hotel.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div><div class=\"modal-footer\"><span class=\"pull-left\"><a href=\"https://conf.researchr.org/details/fse-2025/fse-2025-research-papers/105/Mitigating-Emergent-Malware-Label-Noise-in-DNN-Based-Android-Malware-Detection\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"btn btn-default navigate\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-new-window\"></span> All Details</a></span><a href=\"#\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" class=\"btn btn-default\"><span class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-remove\"></span> Close</a></div></div></div></div>"},{ "action": "runscript", "value": "$('#modal-85cbd22b-1cfc-4d96-99ad-8b5f95cf1548').modal({ backdrop: 'static', keyboard: true}, 'show');" },
